      {
        "id": "candidate-threshold-heading",
        "type": "markdown",
        "body": "## 冻结候选与精确门槛\n\n以下逐项保留每个候选的固定触发阈值。DP 数字按 `M/N/E/D=错音/漏音/多音/拖拍` 顺序列出；完整 JSON 阈值仍保留在图表数据详情与 P1 预注册源中。\n\n- **Gap 复核**（复核提示）：conf[M/N/E/D]=0.45/0.45/0.55/0.45; pitch[M/N/E/D]=0.5/0.5/0.5/0.5; del[M/N/E/D]=0.8/0.8/0.8/0.8; ins[M/N/E/D]=1.1/0.8/1.1/0.8; merge[M/N/E/D]=0.2/0.45/0.2/0.2; dur[M/N/E/D]=0.3/0.15/0.3/0.15; reattack[M/N/E/D]=0.7/0.7/0.85/0.7; dragDur[M/N/E/D]=1.3/1.3/1.3/1.3; dragIOI[M/N/E/D]=0.15/0.15/0.15/0.15; rule=gap AND same-position substitution/deletion-in-gap-run\n- **Gap 严格漏音**（自动指控）：conf[M/N/E/D]=0.45/0.45/0.55/0.45; pitch[M/N/E/D]=0.5/0.5/0.5/0.5; del[M/N/E/D]=0.8/0.8/0.8/0.8; ins[M/N/E/D]=1.1/0.8/1.1/0.8; merge[M/N/E/D]=0.2/0.45/0.2/0.2; dur[M/N/E/D]=0.3/0.15/0.3/0.15; reattack[M/N/E/D]=0.7/0.7/0.85/0.7; dragDur[M/N/E/D]=1.3/1.3/1.3/1.3; dragIOI[M/N/E/D]=0.15/0.15/0.15/0.15; missing only; maxGapCount=5; maxGapRate=0.1\n- **IOI/时值复核**（复核提示）：conf[M/N/E/D]=0.45/0.45/0.55/0.45; pitch[M/N/E/D]=0.5/0.5/0.5/0.5; del[M/N/E/D]=0.8/0.8/0.8/0.8; ins[M/N/E/D]=1.1/0.8/1.1/0.8; merge[M/N/E/D]=0.2/0.45/0.2/0.2; dur[M/N/E/D]=0.3/0.15/0.3/0.15; reattack[M/N/E/D]=0.7/0.7/0.85/0.7; dragDur[M/N/E/D]=1.3/1.3/1.3/1.3; dragIOI[M/N/E/D]=0.15/0.15/0.15/0.15; relIOI>0.15; duration≥1.2; confidence≥0.75\n- **IOI/时值严格**（自动指控）：conf[M/N/E/D]=0.45/0.45/0.55/0.45; pitch[M/N/E/D]=0.5/0.5/0.5/0.5; del[M/N/E/D]=0.8/0.8/0.8/0.8; ins[M/N/E/D]=1.1/0.8/1.1/0.8; merge[M/N/E/D]=0.2/0.45/0.2/0.2; dur[M/N/E/D]=0.3/0.15/0.3/0.15; reattack[M/N/E/D]=0.7/0.7/0.85/0.7; dragDur[M/N/E/D]=1.3/1.3/1.3/1.3; dragIOI[M/N/E/D]=0.15/0.15/0.15/0.15; relIOI>0.15; duration≥1.3; confidence≥0.75\n- **音高轨迹严格**（自动指控）：pitchTolerance=50.0c; spreadP95-P05≤80.0c; IQR≤80.0c; frames≥12; voicedFrames≥12; voicedRatio≥0.7; glissTail=0.35\n- **起音密度严格**（自动指控）：extra DP: conf=0.55, pitch=0.5, del=0.8, ins=1.1, merge=0.2, dur=0.3, reattack=0.85, dragDur=1.3, dragIOI=0.15; interiorAttack≥0.85; startMargin=max(0.12 seconds, 20% event duration); endMargin=max(0.06 seconds, 8% event duration)\n- **时序操作并集**（复核提示）：conf[M/N/E/D]=0.45/0.45/0.55/0.45; pitch[M/N/E/D]=0.5/0.5/0.5/0.5; del[M/N/E/D]=0.8/0.8/0.8/0.8; ins[M/N/E/D]=1.1/0.8/1.1/0.8; merge[M/N/E/D]=0.2/0.45/0.2/0.2; dur[M/N/E/D]=0.3/0.15/0.3/0.15; reattack[M/N/E/D]=0.7/0.7/0.85/0.7; dragDur[M/N/E/D]=1.3/1.3/1.3/1.3; dragIOI[M/N/E/D]=0.15/0.15/0.15/0.15; union=match/insert/delete/merge/split\n\n### 冻结后的真实干净域结果\n\n- **Gap 复核**：本地 `5/743=6.73/1000；单条最高 4.48%`；Round 5 `3/624=4.81/1000；单条最高 1.92%`；公开专业 `1008/6652=151.53/1000；单条最高 22.58%`；淘汰原因：public-professional-pooled-burden；public-professional-recording-burden。\n- **Gap 严格漏音**：本地 `1/743=1.35/1000；单条最高 2.27%`；Round 5 `2/624=3.21/1000；单条最高 1.92%`；公开专业 `0/6652=0.00/1000；单条最高 0.00%`；淘汰原因：authoritative-local-clean-false-positive；consumed-round5-known-negative-false-positive。\n- **IOI/时值复核**：本地 `7/743=9.42/1000；单条最高 8.89%`；Round 5 `0/624=0.00/1000；单条最高 0.00%`；公开专业 `37/6652=5.56/1000；单条最高 1.23%`；淘汰原因：authoritative-local-clean-recording-hint-rate。\n- **IOI/时值严格**：本地 `2/743=2.69/1000；单条最高 4.35%`；Round 5 `0/624=0.00/1000；单条最高 0.00%`；公开专业 `37/6652=5.56/1000；单条最高 1.23%`；淘汰原因：authoritative-local-clean-false-positive；public-professional-pooled-burden；public-professional-recording-burden。\n- **音高轨迹严格**：本地 `不适用`；Round 5 `不适用`；公开专业 `不适用`；淘汰原因：authoritative-local-clean-false-positive。\n- **起音密度严格**：本地 `232/743=312.25/1000；单条最高 54.90%`；Round 5 `64/624=102.56/1000；单条最高 21.15%`；公开专业 `124/6652=18.64/1000；单条最高 10.72%`；淘汰原因：authoritative-local-clean-false-positive；consumed-round5-known-negative-false-positive；public-professional-pooled-burden；public-professional-recording-burden。\n- **时序操作并集**：本地 `289/743=388.96/1000；单条最高 69.57%`；Round 5 `116/624=185.90/1000；单条最高 30.77%`；公开专业 `3371/6652=506.76/1000；单条最高 67.39%`；淘汰原因：authoritative-local-clean-pooled-hint-rate；authoritative-local-clean-recording-hint-rate；consumed-round5-pooled-hint-rate；consumed-round5-recording-hint-rate；public-professional-pooled-burden；public-professional-recording-burden。\n\n后附表只保留角色、违反上限数与最终决策；逐域精确负担仍在上方和底层数据中。",
        "sourceId": "p1-prereg"
